      "quoted": "τοὺς δὲ λόγους τούτους οὐκ ἴσασιν ὅ τι νοοῦσιν",
      "text": "‘they do not know these words what they mean’ – ‘they do not know what these words mean.’ This is a very common pattern of word order in Greek, which can be difficult for speakers of English. See p. 77, note on 6C line 8.",
